@startuml
title Weather Station System States

[*] --> Running : Shutdown
state "Running" as Running
state "Configuration Mode" as ConfigurationMode
state "Collecting Data" as CollectingData
state "Preparing Summary" as PreparingSummary
state "Checking Status" as CheckingStatus
state "Controlled Mode" as ControlledMode
state "Shutdown Condition" as ShutdownCondition

Running --> ConfigurationMode : Changes/Power-saving settings
Running --> CollectingData : Clock trigger
Running --> PreparingSummary : Summary request
Running --> CheckingStatus : Status check request
Running --> ControlledMode : Remote control
Running --> ShutdownCondition : Shutdown command

ConfigurationMode --> Running : Configuration completed
ControlledMode --> Running : Activity completion
ShutdownCondition --> ShutdownCondition : Successful shutdown


title Alert Notifier Component States

[*] --> InitializeComponent : Load Component
state "Initialize\nComponent" as InitializeComponent
state "Waiting for Update" as WaitingForUpdate
state "Processing Update" as ProcessingUpdate
state "Unloading" as Unloading

InitializeComponent --> WaitingForUpdate : Successful initialization
WaitingForUpdate --> WaitingForUpdate : No update detected
WaitingForUpdate --> ProcessingUpdate : Update detected
ProcessingUpdate --> WaitingForUpdate : Update processed
Unloading --> [*] : System shutdown or failure


title Equihealth States

[*] --> J1 : [check user]
state J1 <<choice>>
state PatientDashboard : Patient
state HealthWorkerDashboard : Health Worker
state GovernmentOfficialDashboard : Government Official
state Logout : Logout

J1 --> PatientDashboard : Patient
J1 --> HealthWorkerDashboard : Health Worker
J1 --> GovernmentOfficialDashboard : Government Official
Logout --> [*] : User completes tasks

PatientDashboard --> [*] : Provide medical information
HealthWorkerDashboard --> [*] : Check and analyze medical information
GovernmentOfficialDashboard --> [*] : View health planning results


title National Health Id States

[*] --> Choice1
state Choice1 <<choice>>
state Choice2
state Choice3
Choice1 --> Verification : Indian
Choice1 --> [*] : not Indian

Verification : entry / Citizenship status
Verification : do / Verify details
Verification : exit / Verified status

@enduml
